Every CI step is a pure function of its inputs. The primitive is `.github/actions/cached-step` (litlfred/folio-assistant#2972).

- **Trust classes:**
  - (a) entries that can be verified exactly: committers may publish them with `cache:publish`, and CI only verifies them;
  - (b) verdicts, which go through #2957 and #2958;
  - (c) main-only entries.
- **Daily report:** the hit-rate and budget repo

## Evidence
Code-quality gates repeats its setup in every job:
- no bun install cache;
- `smart:pages` runs 17 times and `ig-index:build` 10 times per run;
- the qa-working-copy → publish-pages chain sits in front of most jobs.

Worked by the sibling "CI speed 1" of session https://claude.ai/code/session_01VQDpPffYARDQ8juksAZScf. The two `cisp` children closed undone are filed under this epic as c
